      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAY TIME (1) is worth forgiving last start after finishing fourth (23.22) from Box 2 at this track over 400m. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with three wins from three starts. Has ability and looks hard to stop. PHOENIX VIOLET (8) ran a good 23.02 when filling a minor placing over 400m at this track last start. Should be in this for a long way. INSINUATING (5) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a one length second (27.63) behind Paw Elodee at Horsham. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from five starts. Winning chance. WINNING HAND (2) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
